/-- A planar source-middle component has arbitrary rapid decay in the high
source radius even when the output radius stays in the compact `I₀` cell. -/
theorem exists_uniform_iteratedDeriv_brrsPlanarTwoRadiusStationaryCoefficient_lowHigh_middleSource_rapidDecay
    (N M : Nat) (hM : 2 ≤ M) (Phi : BRRSAnnularCutoff)
